cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this forecast, its data or its code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Brazil 2026 presidential runoff: a pre-registered forecast"
abstract: >-
  A pre-registered Bayesian aggregation of 58 TSE-registered national runoff polls for Brazil's
  2026-10-25 presidential runoff, sealed (hashed, anchored in Bitcoin and captured by the
  Internet Archive) before the polls closed and scored against the official count afterwards,
  with a companion study of polarization in a near-even electorate.
authors:
